  "segments": [
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0001",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 0.83,
      "end_seconds": 4.01,
      "duration_seconds": 3.18,
      "text": "Morning, doctor. Lovely to meet you."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0002",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 5.66,
      "end_seconds": 11.4,
      "duration_seconds": 5.74,
      "text": "You're alright, take a a seat. What can I do for you?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0003",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 12.9,
      "end_seconds": 20.96,
      "duration_seconds": 8.06,
      "text": "right, honestly, it's burning when I pass urine, and and my family pushed me to come"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0004",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 22.24,
      "end_seconds": 24.02,
      "duration_seconds": 1.78,
      "text": "anything that improves it?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0005",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 24.91,
      "end_seconds": 28.58,
      "duration_seconds": 3.67,
      "text": "I get some relief from drinking water."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0006",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 29.61,
      "end_seconds": 34.04,
      "duration_seconds": 4.43,
      "text": "has there been a sudden urgent need to go too?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0007",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 35.93,
      "end_seconds": 38.81,
      "duration_seconds": 2.88,
      "text": "yes, you know, I have"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0008",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 40.8,
      "end_seconds": 45.79,
      "duration_seconds": 4.99,
      "text": "so, and what about blood in the urine, vaginal discharge or vomiting?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0009",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 47.6,
      "end_seconds": 50.67,
      "duration_seconds": 3.07,
      "text": "no, not a a single one"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0010",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 51.94,
      "end_seconds": 56.98,
      "duration_seconds": 5.04,
      "text": "Let me check a few things. Any loin pain or fever?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0011",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 58.55,
      "end_seconds": 62.84,
      "duration_seconds": 4.29,
      "text": "Erm, I haven't had loin pain or fever, no."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0012",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 63.17,
      "end_seconds": 66.98,
      "duration_seconds": 3.81,
      "text": "right, right. Any problems with your joints or muscles?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0013",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 68.92,
      "end_seconds": 70.4,
      "duration_seconds": 1.48,
      "text": "No, nothing there."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0014",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 70.92,
      "end_seconds": 73.57,
      "duration_seconds": 2.65,
      "text": "any breathing difficulties apart from this?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0015",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 74.91,
      "end_seconds": 76.79,
      "duration_seconds": 1.88,
      "text": "no problems with breathing"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0016",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 77.63,
      "end_seconds": 85.67,
      "duration_seconds": 8.04,
      "text": "Are there any allergies I should be aware of? I ask because it it helps me narrow things down."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0017",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 87.49,
      "end_seconds": 90.59,
      "duration_seconds": 3.1,
      "text": "Right, I've never had an allergy."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0018",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 108.86,
      "end_seconds": 111.84,
      "duration_seconds": 2.98,
      "text": "has anyone ever diagnosed you with something?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0019",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 112.7,
      "end_seconds": 114.12,
      "duration_seconds": 1.42,
      "text": "I have diabetes"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0020",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 115.93,
      "end_seconds": 124.05,
      "duration_seconds": 8.12,
      "text": "Yes. Okay I can see diabetes in your file as well. What operations have you had if any?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0021",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 125.54,
      "end_seconds": 130.02,
      "duration_seconds": 4.48,
      "text": "I had a varicose vein procedure last year"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0022",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 131.36,
      "end_seconds": 135.37,
      "duration_seconds": 4.01,
      "text": "can you list what you take tablets creams or inhalers?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0023",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 135.88,
      "end_seconds": 148.57,
      "duration_seconds": 12.69,
      "text": "uh it's gliclazide 80 milligrams twice a day for my sugar. Cranberry juice every day. I took the morning off to come in today"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0024",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 149.69,
      "end_seconds": 150.97,
      "duration_seconds": 1.28,
      "text": "and your job?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0025",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 151.85,
      "end_seconds": 155.61,
      "duration_seconds": 3.76,
      "text": "I work in accounts at a hospital."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0026",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 157.42,
      "end_seconds": 159.6,
      "duration_seconds": 2.18,
      "text": "do you do any exercise?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0027",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 161.11,
      "end_seconds": 163.72,
      "duration_seconds": 2.61,
      "text": "I swim twice a week"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0028",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 165.68,
      "end_seconds": 168.28,
      "duration_seconds": 2.6,
      "text": "let me take your readings now"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0029",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 174.44,
      "end_seconds": 176.73,
      "duration_seconds": 2.29,
      "text": "sit still for a moment.."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0030",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 195.16,
      "end_seconds": 205.04,
      "duration_seconds": 9.88,
      "text": "Okay: temperature 36.6 pressure 110 over 82. And respiratory rate 17 pulse is 77 beats a minute oxygen saturation is 97 percent."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0031",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 208.46,
      "end_seconds": 210.08,
      "duration_seconds": 1.62,
      "text": "is that normal?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0032",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 211.7,
      "end_seconds": 214.65,
      "duration_seconds": 2.95,
      "text": "I'll come back to the the numbers"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0033",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 217.23,
      "end_seconds": 221.31,
      "duration_seconds": 4.08,
      "text": "I'd like to check you over now if that's alright"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0034",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 222.98,
      "end_seconds": 224.84,
      "duration_seconds": 1.86,
      "text": "Right does that hurt?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0035",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 235.29,
      "end_seconds": 241.34,
      "duration_seconds": 6.05,
      "text": "your tummy is soft with mild tenderness low down and no pain in the loins"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0036",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 256.85,
      "end_seconds": 257.97,
      "duration_seconds": 1.12,
      "text": "Sure thing."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0037",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 262.41,
      "end_seconds": 264.48,
      "duration_seconds": 2.07,
      "text": "all finished, thank you"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0038",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 282.92,
      "end_seconds": 299.63,
      "duration_seconds": 16.71,
      "text": "Right here's what I'm thinking. The most likely explanation is a lower urinary tract infection. Vaginal irritation is still possible. I want a urine test done that's for dysuria. I'll request a urine culture it'll help with recurrent urinary infection."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0039",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 300.98,
      "end_seconds": 303.79,
      "duration_seconds": 2.81,
      "text": "erm how long will it take?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0040",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 305.28,
      "end_seconds": 337.03,
      "duration_seconds": 31.75,
      "text": "the treatment will be nitrofurantoin, 100 milligrams, twice a day, for three days. You take it by mouth. That's for urinary infection. Drink plenty of water and don't hold on when you need to go. Try to keep a simple diary of when it happens and what you were doing, and bring it to the next visit. Can you tell me the plan back in your own words, so I know I've explained it clearly?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0041",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 338.36,
      "end_seconds": 345.05,
      "duration_seconds": 6.69,
      "text": "so, I take the nitrofurantoin, 100 milligrams, twice a day is that right?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0042",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 345.91,
      "end_seconds": 351.06,
      "duration_seconds": 5.15,
      "text": "yes exactly right that's everything on my side anything you're unsure about?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0043",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 353.09,
      "end_seconds": 357.74,
      "duration_seconds": 4.65,
      "text": "Hmm, good, thanks, I'll see you then."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0044",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
